lt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n有好多宝可梦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n被带到的地方……\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n没想到竟然是！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n欢迎展板！\n和\n宝可梦们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n签名板上是\n宝可梦EXPO Gym的皮卡丘\n和\n可达鸭（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/002-c2ba1dd968.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/002-c2ba1dd968.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"987\" height=\"808\"></a></figure>\n\n没想到会这样，\n吓了我一跳！！\n谢谢你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这只皮卡丘是\n这里的\n官方商店限定款！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/003-78bbdc2d41.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/003-78bbdc2d41.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n                然后\n            \n宝可梦的话语\n会翻译成日语的\n这张卡！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/004-defa548617.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/004-defa548617.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n宝可梦翻译卡！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这样一来，\n宝可梦之间的对话\n就能用日语听到了（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n那么，出发！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n入口处有一颗\n巨大的精灵球！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/005-f0d7f063ce.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/005-f0d7f063ce.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n大到连增田都能进去（笑）\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n首先上二楼\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/006-9d459449cc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/006-9d459449cc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"517\" height=\"417\"></a></figure>\n\n这个好可爱！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n首先\n\n自己出拳的话\n<br>\n\n\n路卡利欧也会出拳！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/007-68bf554f1c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/007-68bf554f1c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"853\" height=\"725\"></a></figure>\n\n同步的！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还有跳跃和躲避等动作，\n\n是相当有挑战性的游戏！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后这个是\n<br>\n\n\n寻找宝可梦的游戏！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/008-8b644bd986.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/008-8b644bd986.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n参考提示等内容，\n一边快速切换画面，\n一边寻找指定的宝可梦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                            接下来是\n两个人一起玩的\n保龄球游戏！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/009-be417a4878.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/009-be417a4878.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n增田用身体操纵\n骑在球上的小猫怪（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n如果是写着“效果绝佳！”的球瓶，\n速度就会加快！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                                两个人能不能配合好\n是关键！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n最后是\n皮卡丘宣传摄影棚！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/010-d704052847.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/010-d704052847.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n皮卡丘可爱地\n用日语和我说话，真开心（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n它还叫了增田的名字！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/011-a19052b9c6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/011-a19052b9c6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n和皮卡丘一起跳舞啦！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n还发现了墙上的可达鸭！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/012-c1a346c01f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/012-c1a346c01f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n“嘎！”\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/013-5ddd9bfc73.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/013-5ddd9bfc73.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"565\" height=\"685\"></a></figure>\n\n这里还有\n只有这里才有的原创果汁\n和爆米花盒！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/014-658e99f95c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/014-658e99f95c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这里有各种各样的机关，\n宝可梦EXPO Gym\n真的很开心！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家也一定要\n踏入这个\n能听到宝可梦说话的\n不可思议空间\n看看哦！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n工作人员们，\n谢谢你们为我画签名板，\n还为此做了准备，\n真的非常感谢！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！</div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ずっと行きたかった</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンEXPOジム</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ついに来ることが出来ました！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/001-9f9dbc9494.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/001-9f9dbc9494.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nポケモンがたくさん！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n通された場所に・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまさかの！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nウェルカムボード！\nと\nポケモンたち！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n色紙には\nポケモンEXPOジムのピカチュウ\nと\nコダック（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/002-c2ba1dd968.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/002-c2ba1dd968.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"987\" height=\"808\"></a></figure>\n\nまさかの展開に\nビックリしました！！\nありがとうございます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこのピカチュウは\nここの\nオフィシャルショップ限定！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/003-78bbdc2d41.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/003-78bbdc2d41.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                そして\n            \nポケモンの言葉が\n日本語翻訳になる\nこのカード！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/004-defa548617.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/004-defa548617.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nポケペラ！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれで\nポケモンの会話は\n日本語で聞こえます（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nでは出発！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n入口には\n巨大なモンスターボール！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/005-f0d7f063ce.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/005-f0d7f063ce.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nマスダも中に入れそうな大きさ（笑）\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまずは2階へ\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/006-9d459449cc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/006-9d459449cc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"517\" height=\"417\"></a></figure>\n\nこれかわいい！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまず最初に\n\n自分がパンチすると\n<br>\n\n\n\nルカリオもパンチ！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/007-68bf554f1c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/007-68bf554f1c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"853\" height=\"725\"></a></figure>\n\nリンクしてる！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nジャンプや避けなどもあって\n\nなかなかやりがいのある遊び！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそしてこちらは\n<br>\n\n\nポケモンを探す遊び！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/008-8b644bd986.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/008-8b644bd986.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nヒントなどを頼りに\n素早く画面を切り替えつつ\n指示されたポケモンを探す！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                            そして次は\nふたりで遊ぶ\nボーリングゲーム！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/009-be417a4878.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/009-be417a4878.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nマスダはボールに乗ったコリンクを\n身体にて操縦（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\nこうかばつぐん！のピンだと\n速度が速くなる！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                                ふたりの息を合わせるのが\nポイント！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして最後に\nピカチュウのプロモスタジオ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/010-d704052847.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/010-d704052847.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nピカチュウが可愛らしく\n日本語でしゃべってくれる喜び（笑）\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\nマスダの名前も呼んでくれた！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/011-a19052b9c6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/011-a19052b9c6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nピカチュウと一緒に踊ったよ！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n壁にいるコダックも発見！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/012-c1a346c01f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/012-c1a346c01f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n「ぐわっ！」\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/013-5ddd9bfc73.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/013-5ddd9bfc73.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"565\" height=\"685\"></a></figure>\n\nここだけの\nオリジナルジュースや\nポップコーンケースも！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/014-658e99f95c.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3752587/014-658e99f95c.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nいろんな仕掛け盛りだくさんで\nポケモンEXPOジム\n楽しかったです！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみなさんも是非\nポケモンがしゃべる\n不思議な空間に\n足を踏み入れてみて\nくださいね！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nスタッフのみなさん\n色紙描いてくれたり\n準備してくれて\n本当にありがとうございました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！</div>"}}